OL,3,ABreaking Bad actor RJ Mitte dies aged
OL,4,A34
OL,5,
OL,6,FMitte, who lived with cerebral palsy,
OL,7,Fdrew on his own experience for his role
OL,8,Fin the Emmy-winning drama series
OL,9,Fstarring Bryan Cranston and Aaron Paul.
OL,10,FHe earned a Screen Actors Guild Award
OL,11,Fin 2014 for his work on the series.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
